<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Vijaya Lakshmi - Portfolio</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
      color: #333;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    header {
      background-color: #007BFF;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
    }
    section {
      padding: 2rem;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: auto;
    }
    h2 {
      color: #007BFF;
    }
    ul {
      list-style-type: square;
      padding-left: 20px;
    }
    a {
      color: #007BFF;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
    footer {
      background-color: #007BFF;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Vijaya Lakshmi</h1>
    <p>3rd Semester B.Tech CSE</p>
  </header>

  <section id="about">
    <h2>About</h2>
    <p>
      I am a Computer Science student passionate about programming and problem-solving. 
      I enjoy working with C in VS Code, exploring data structures, and collaborating on GitHub projects.
      My current goal is to earn a 3-star HackerRank badge to strengthen my portfolio.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="projects">
    <h2>Projects</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/vijayalaksmi14/hello-world" target="_blank">Hello World Repository</a> — My first GitHub repo created during VS Code setup.</li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/vijayalaksmi14/pair-programming-log" target="_blank">Pair Programming Collaboration Log</a> — Documented teamwork using GitLens and Live Share.</li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/vijayalaksmi14/leetcode-solutions" target="_blank">LeetCode Solutions Repository</a> — Contains my solutions and progress on problem-solving tasks.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="skills">
    <h2>Skills</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>C programming and debugging in VS Code</li>
      <li>Git and GitHub workflow</li>
      <li>Data structures and algorithms practice</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="contact">
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>You can reach me via my GitHub profile: 
      <a href="https://github.com/vijayalaksmi14" target="_blank">github.com/vijayalaksmi14</a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 Vijaya Lakshmi | Portfolio Blog</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
